{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09131","headline":"送郑长源 · 韦应物","name":"送郑长源","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"少年一相见，飞辔河洛间。\n欢游不知罢，中路忽言还。\n泠泠鵾弦哀，悄悄冬夜闲。\n丈夫虽耿介，远别多苦颜。\n君行拜高堂，速驾难久攀。\n鸡鸣俦侣发，朔雪满河关。\n须臾在今夕，罇酌且循环。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09131.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09131","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}